  "title": "Billie S NDE 6268",
  "date": "around 1974 or earlier",
  "content": "This is my 2 or 3 year-old words (my daughter was the one that 'died'): 'Mommy I was in that place.' She drew a drawing: totally colored black except for floating figures near the top of the page. There was a small building shaped object in the left upper corner. She said she was trying to get home and there were angels around her. She was still in the hospital at the time following the unsuccessful surgery. The medical team was keeping her there in case of any other problems. I read the medical report after her doctor was called out of the room; it didn't make too much sense. The report stated that she had turned blue and had to be resuscitated. That she was under great stress and the operation was halted. She never did get the ear tubes inserted into both ears; just one was inserted. I am her mom aged 69 years. I was so alarmed at her repeating that the angels had come to get her that I signed her out of the hospital myself. The hospital told me that it was against all policies and that if I took her home I was on my own. She was put into my bed, she said, 'keep that boy away from me'. She slept solidly for two days.",
